From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Kuraev <naoru.desu@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 00:06:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 69/73] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: keep DisplayPort audio
 probeable while unplugged

Add kernel patches 0148-0150: upstream d858770e86e7, start the DisplayPort back end before its front end and refuse that start in the SM8250 machine driver while no display is connected, and start the q6afe DisplayPort port from the trigger instead of prepare. Advance to release 87.
